<p>More from this author: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/poi-3181-198-file">http://www.scp-wiki.net/poi-3181-198-file</a></p>
<p>Hurray! My second solo article!<br />
The idea for this one is almost as old as the first one. Only a few days younger.</p>
<p>This one is mostly about some body-horror and seeing if I can use expungements effectively, as they, in theory, always tickled me. The fact that this is expunged, not redacted, is very deliberate. I tried to make it clear what happens in the superbia event, but that's not the interesting part anyway. The interesting part is the &quot;Further handlings&quot; section. Because what do you do now?</p>
