			<div class="content" id="post-content-4330552">
									

<p>Thanks for the read!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">My&nbsp;intent</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>So, from how i intended this, this isnt about him being a reality bender, or potentially dangerous, but him being literally jedud, with all the memories and implications. This is the son of god and they had to&#8230; do something with him right? A big part of foundation employees are probably Christian. How do you explain this to them? They canr just release him to the public, they canr just put him in a normal containment chamber. How would you explain that? So no matter what they did, they had to ensure that people dont know what it was.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Thats how I intended this to be interpreted. Cant guarantee what you take from it of course, but maybe this cleared it up a bit at least.</p>

